# Materials for the formed gate (from "Stargate" by Chaitanya Krishnan, CC-BY-4.0).
# Ka > 0 makes a material emissive (NeoForge OBJ loader, emissive_ambient).

newmtl gate
Kd 1 1 1
Ka 0 0 0
map_Kd #ring

newmtl gate_grey
Kd 0.45 0.45 0.45
Ka 0 0 0
map_Kd #white

newmtl glow
Kd 1 0.62 0.12
Ka 1 1 1
map_Kd #white

newmtl event_horizon
Kd 1 1 1
Ka 1 1 1
map_Kd #horizon
